# A trade corridor between three partners. Amounts are in cents.
# PARTY ID DEPOSIT CLAIM WEIGHT: the weight shares the fee dividend.
TREATY CORRIDOR-7 USD SETL
PARTY ACME 5000000 4000 1/3
PARTY BETA 3000000 3000001 1/7
PARTY GAMMA 900000 0 11/21
# OWE FROM TO AMOUNT: who owes whom before netting.
OWE ACME BETA 1200000
OWE BETA GAMMA 700000
OWE GAMMA ACME 100000
END
